sequenceDiagram
  participant S1 as Sender A
  participant S2 as Sender B
  participant L as inbox file lock
  participant F as recipient.json
  participant R as Recipient
  S1->>L: acquire
  S1->>F: read + append + write
  S1->>L: release
  S2->>L: acquire
  S2->>F: read + append + write
  S2->>L: release
  R->>F: read unread
  R->>L: mark index/all read under lock
